    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "You clearly, because I know you know Ukraine well, you were born there, you have family there, you know what the Ukrainians have been through over the last three years, you know what a defence the Ukrainian military has put up to resist Russian aggression, you know how many thousands of lives have been lost and you know how successful The Ukrainian military has been in blocking Putin's ambitions to essentially go to Kiev and install a puppet government. You know what Ukraine has achieved. So why will you not acknowledge that? And acknowledge also that you disagree with your own President Trump, who now characterizes Zelensky as a dictator and says they started the war, both of which are plainly untrue.",
