  {
    "episode_id": 75387,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75387.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 50,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, let's move from foreign policy if we may before we end the interview to what's happening inside the United States of America. You as a politician have always been a very loud advocate of cutting government. So I'm guessing that you are delighted to see what Elon Musk and his Department of Government efficiency are doing to the federal government. But are you also delighted that in the course of trying to slash jobs across the federal government, He appears to be compromising safety at the National Nuclear Security Administration. He appears to have fired people at the US Centre for Disease Control and Prevention who have had to be re-hired because of the dangers that has posed. This looks like chaos rather than efficiency.",
