        "text": "The speaker believes that political leaders should prioritize institutional stability over ideological cost-cutting.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The journalist views Elon Musk’s involvement in federal governance as unqualified and potentially dangerous.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The interviewer assumes that the politician supports deregulation and downsizing regardless of consequences.",
