        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Judicial independence is essential for maintaining constitutional order and legal accountability.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Intimidation of judges by political leaders undermines the legitimacy of the entire legal system.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The current actions of Elon Musk and Doge represent a serious threat to institutional integrity.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
