  {
    "episode_id": 75387,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75387.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 60,
    "turn_text": "Well, listen, actually, I mean, we need to see who those think tanks are getting paid for. A lot of them are from the same government programs that would try to see where corruption is. So I would take everything with the grain of salt, but my main role to sell this republic. And Elon Musk and President Trump are strong allies. They understand that we're in deep trouble, but I need to make sure that the things that they try to find, the bad things that happen in government will put it in the law, because I agree. We are article one branch. We have to have this law. So it has more lasting effect, not just for one administration. And Congress needs to start exercising its power and responsibility. So that is my job, and I'll do my best to convince my Republicans and work with them that we have to have some courage to do the right thing for the country.",
